{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03145","headline":"祠紫盖山经玉泉山寺 · 张九龄","name":"祠紫盖山经玉泉山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"指涂跻楚望，策马傍荆岑。\n稍稍松篁入，泠泠磵谷深。\n观奇逐幽暎，历险忘岖嶔。\n上界投佛影，中天扬梵音。\n焚香忏在昔，礼足誓来今。\n灵异若有对，神仙真可寻。\n高僧闻逝者，远俗是初心。\n藓驳经行处，猿啼燕坐林。\n归真已寂灭，留迹岂[湮沈]。\n法地自兹广，何云千万金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}